(19, '{\"en\":\"Cardiac Catheterization Laboratory (Cath Lab)\",\"ar\":\"مختبر قسطرة القلب \"}', 13, '{\"en\":\"<p>The Cath Lab at Al Nas Hospital is a state-of-the-art facility equipped with three specialized rooms: an Adult &amp; Pediatric Room, an Electrophysiology Room, and a Hybrid Room. Together, they deliver comprehensive diagnostic and interventional cardiac care of the highest quality for both children and adults. The Cath Lab team applies the most advanced methods to treat rare and life-threatening cardiac conditions, requiring exceptional technical expertise and close multidisciplinary collaboration.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>يُعد مختبر قسطرة القلب بمستشفى الناس منشأة متطورة تضم ثلاث غرف متخصصة: غرفة للبالغين والأطفال، وغرفة الفيزيولوجيا الكهربية (Electrophysiology)، وغرفة هجينة (Hybrid Room). وتعمل هذه الغرف مجتمعة على تقديم رعاية قلبية تشخيصية وتداخلية شاملة بأعلى معايير الجودة للأطفال والبالغين.</p><p>يعتمد فريق القسطرة على أحدث التقنيات لعلاج الحالات القلبية النادرة والمهددة للحياة، وهو ما يتطلب خبرة تقنية عالية وتعاونًا وثيقًا بين مختلف التخصصات الطبية.</p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>The Cath Lab provides diagnostic and interventional cardiac procedures, electrophysiological studies, and complex structural interventions. By combining cutting-edge imaging technology with advanced minimally invasive techniques, the unit reduces the need for open-heart surgery and ensures safer, faster recoveries for patients across all age groups.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>يقدّم مختبر القسطرة إجراءات تشخيصية وتداخلية للقلب، ودراسات الفيزيولوجيا الكهربية، وتدخلات بنيوية معقدة. ومن خلال الدمج بين تقنيات التصوير المتقدمة والإجراءات طفيفة التوغل، تسهم الوحدة في تقليل الحاجة إلى جراحات القلب المفتوح، وتضمن تعافيًا أسرع وأكثر أمانًا للمرضى من جميع الفئات العمرية.</p>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"What we treat\",\"ar\":\"\\u0645\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u064a \\u0646\\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0647 \"},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p>Our Cath Lab specializes in diagnosing and treating a wide range of heart conditions, from coronary and valvular disease to complex congenital and structural cardiac anomalies:<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>\\u064a\\u062e\\u062a\\u0635 \\u0645\\u0639\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0637\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062f\\u064a\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0628\\u062a\\u0634\\u062e\\u064a\\u0635 \\u0648\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c \\u0645\\u062c\\u0645\\u0648\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0633\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u060c \\u0628\\u062f\\u0621\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0631\\u0627\\u064a\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0627\\u062c\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0635\\u0645\\u0627\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u060c \\u0648\\u0635\\u0648\\u0644\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0634\\u0648\\u0647\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628<\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Congenital heart defects in neonates, children, and adults\",\"ar\":\"\\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u064e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062f\\u0649 \\u062d\\u062f\\u064a\\u062b\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u063a\\u064a\\u0646.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Coronary artery disease requiring angioplasty or stenting\",\"ar\":\"\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0631\\u0627\\u064a\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0627\\u062c\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u064a \\u062a\\u062a\\u0637\\u0644\\u0628 \\u062a\\u0648\\u0633\\u064a\\u0639 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0631\\u0627\\u064a\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0623\\u0648 \\u062a\\u0631\\u0643\\u064a\\u0628 \\u062f\\u0639\\u0627\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Complex arrhythmias and conduction abnormalities\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0636\\u0637\\u0631\\u0627\\u0628\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0638\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0645\\u0634\\u0643\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0648\\u0635\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0647\\u0631\\u0628\\u064a.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Structural heart conditions requiring advanced hybrid interventions\",\"ar\":\"\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0646\\u064a\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u064a \\u062a\\u0633\\u062a\\u0644\\u0632\\u0645 \\u062a\\u062f\\u062e\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0647\\u062c\\u064a\\u0646\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Patients requiring device implantation for rhythm management\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u064a\\u0646 \\u064a\\u062d\\u062a\\u0627\\u062c\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0632\\u0631\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0623\\u062c\\u0647\\u0632\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062a\\u0646\\u0638\\u064a\\u0645 \\u0636\\u0631\\u0628\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628.\"}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department\",\"ar\":\"\\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":5,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a\"}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\"},\"doctors\":[]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"The Cath Lab has successfully treated thousands of patients, including high-risk neonates and adults with complex structural conditions. The hybrid room has enabled groundbreaking minimally invasive procedures, reducing surgical trauma and improving long-term outcomes. Many success stories highlight children born with severe congenital defects who now lead healthy, active lives after timely interventions at Al Nas Hospital.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0646\\u062c\\u062d \\u0645\\u062e\\u062a\\u0628\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0637\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c \\u0622\\u0644\\u0627\\u0641 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649\\u060c \\u0628\\u0645\\u0646 \\u0641\\u064a\\u0647\\u0645 \\u062d\\u062f\\u064a\\u062b\\u0648 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0630\\u0648\\u0648 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0637\\u0648\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u063a\\u0648\\u0646 \\u064a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0646\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0628\\u0646\\u064a\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629. \\u0648\\u0642\\u062f \\u0623\\u062a\\u0627\\u062d\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u063a\\u0631\\u0641\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0647\\u062c\\u064a\\u0646\\u0629 \\u0625\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621 \\u062a\\u062f\\u062e\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0637\\u0641\\u064a\\u0641\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0648\\u063a\\u0644 \\u0631\\u0627\\u0626\\u062f\\u0629\\u060c \\u0645\\u0627 \\u0633\\u0627\\u0647\\u0645 \\u0641\\u064a \\u062a\\u0642\\u0644\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0636\\u0627\\u0639\\u0641\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u062a\\u062d\\u0633\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u0626\\u062c \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062f\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0648\\u064a\\u0644. \\u0648\\u062a\\u0628\\u0631\\u0632 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u062f\\u064a\\u062f \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0642\\u0635\\u0635 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u062c\\u0627\\u062d \\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0648\\u064f\\u0644\\u062f\\u0648\\u0627 \\u0628\\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0634\\u062f\\u064a\\u062f\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u064a\\u062a\\u0645\\u062a\\u0639\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0648\\u0645 \\u0628\\u062d\\u064a\\u0627\\u0629 \\u0635\\u062d\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0646\\u0634\\u0637\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0641\\u0636\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u062f\\u062e\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0628\\u0643\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0641\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633.\"}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Introduction of next-generation imaging and mapping technologies\",\"ar\":\"\\u0625\\u062f\\u062e\\u0627\\u0644 \\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u062c\\u062f\\u064a\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u062a\\u0635\\u0648\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0648\\u0631\\u0633\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0631\\u0627\\u0626\\u0637.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Expansion of hybrid structural heart procedures\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0648\\u0633\\u0639 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0625\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0646\\u064a\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0647\\u062c\\u064a\\u0646\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Regular workshops and live case demonstrations for global knowledge exchange\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0646\\u0638\\u064a\\u0645 \\u0648\\u0631\\u0634 \\u0639\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0645\\u0646\\u062a\\u0638\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0628\\u062b \\u0645\\u0628\\u0627\\u0634\\u0631 \\u0644\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0644\\u062a\\u0628\\u0627\\u062f\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u064a\\u064b\\u0627.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Launch of specialized training modules for electrophysiology interventions\",\"ar\":\"\\u0625\\u0637\\u0644\\u0627\\u0642 \\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645\\u062c \\u062a\\u062f\\u0631\\u064a\\u0628 \\u0645\\u062a\\u062e\\u0635\\u0635\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u062a\\u062f\\u062e\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u064a\\u0632\\u064a\\u0648\\u0644\\u0648\\u062c\\u064a\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0647\\u0631\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629.\"}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-02-10 16:12:14'),
(20, '{\"en\":\"Cardiovascular Perfusion \",\"ar\":\"الإرواء القلبي الوعائي\"}', 14, '{\"en\":\"<p>The Perfusion Unit plays a critical role in cardiac surgery by providing extracorporeal circulation, oxygenation, and life support during open-heart procedures. The team also manages advanced technologies such as ECMO and ventricular assist devices, ensuring optimal intraoperative and postoperative outcomes.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p><strong>تلعب وحدة الإرواء الدموي دورًا محوريًا في جراحات القلب من خلال توفير الدورة الدموية والأكسجة والدعم الحيوي خارج الجسم أثناء العمليات الجراحية. كما تتولى الوحدة إدارة التقنيات المتقدمة مثل أجهزة ECMO ومساعدات البطين الصناعي، بما يضمن أفضل النتائج أثناء وبعد الجراحة.</strong></p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>The Perfusion Unit specializes in providing advanced cardiopulmonary support for both adult and congenital cardiac surgeries. Services include cardiopulmonary bypass management with goal-directed perfusion, temperature and myocardial protection, mechanical circulatory support such as ECMO, blood conservation and anticoagulation monitoring, and organ protection strategies for the brain, kidneys, and heart.</p><ul><li><p>Cardiopulmonary Bypass (CPB)</p><ul><li><p>Setup, priming, operation, monitoring, and termination of CPB for All adult cases and congenital heart diseases</p></li><li><p>Application of goal-directed perfusion strategies.</p></li><li><p>Temperature management and myocardial protection.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Mechanical Circulatory Support (MCS)</p><ul><li><p>Initiation and management of Extracorporeal Membrane Oxygenation (ECMO) (VA &amp; VV).</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Blood Management</p><ul><li><p>Cell salvage and ultrafiltration.</p></li><li><p>Anticoagulation and coagulation monitoring (ACT)</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Organ Protection</p><ul><li><p>Cerebral and renal perfusion strategies.</p></li><li><p>Delivery of cardioplegia .</p></li></ul></li></ul>\",\"ar\":\"<p>تتخصص <strong>وحدة التروية الدموية</strong> في تقديم الدعم المتقدم للدورة الدموية والتنفس الصناعي أثناء جراحات القلب للبالغين والأطفال المصابين بعيوب قلبية خلقية. وتشمل خدمات الوحدة إدارة جهاز القلب والرئة الصناعي وفق استراتيجيات موجهة لتحقيق أفضل النتائج، وإدارة درجة حرارة الجسم وحماية عضلة القلب، بالإضافة إلى تقديم خدمات الدعم الدوري الميكانيكي مثل جهاز الإيكمو (ECMO)، وبرامج الحفاظ على الدم ومراقبة سيولة الدم، واستراتيجيات حماية الأعضاء الحيوية مثل المخ والكلى والقلب.</p><h3>جهاز القلب والرئة الصناعي (Cardiopulmonary Bypass – CPB)</h3><ul><li><p>تجهيز الجهاز وتحضيره وتشغيله ومراقبته وإنهاء استخدامه لجميع جراحات القلب للبالغين وحالات أمراض القلب الخلقية.</p></li><li><p>تطبيق استراتيجيات التروية الموجهة لتحقيق أفضل كفاءة للدورة الدموية.</p></li><li><p>إدارة درجة حرارة الجسم وحماية عضلة القلب أثناء الجراحة.</p></li></ul><h3>الدعم الدوري الميكانيكي (Mechanical Circulatory Support – MCS)</h3><ul><li><p>بدء وإدارة جهاز الإيكمو (ECMO) بنوعيه الوريدي الشرياني (VA) والوريدي الوريدي (VV).</p></li></ul><h3>إدارة الدم (Blood Management)</h3><ul><li><p>استرجاع الدم أثناء الجراحة (Cell Salvage) والترشيح الفائق (Ultrafiltration).</p></li><li><p>متابعة سيولة الدم ومراقبة عوامل التجلط باستخدام اختبار زمن التجلط المنشط (ACT).</p></li></ul><h3>حماية الأعضاء الحيوية (Organ Protection)</h3><ul><li><p>تطبيق استراتيجيات الحفاظ على تروية المخ والكلى.</p></li><li><p>إعطاء محلول حماية عضلة القلب (Cardioplegia).</p></li></ul>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Eminent procedures\",\"ar\":\"\\u0623\\u0628\\u0631\\u0632 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621\\u0627\\u062a\"},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p>The Perfusion Unit provides advanced cardiopulmonary support and life-sustaining technologies during complex cardiac surgeries, ensuring safe and effective outcomes for both adult and pediatric patients.<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645 \\u0648\\u062d\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0631\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062f\\u0639\\u0645\\u0627\\u064b \\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u064b \\u0644\\u0648\\u0638\\u0627\\u0626\\u0641 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0626\\u062a\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0648\\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u062d\\u064a\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u062d\\u0641\\u0627\\u0638 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u064a\\u0627\\u0629 \\u0623\\u062b\\u0646\\u0627\\u0621 \\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629\\u060c \\u0628\\u0645\\u0627 \\u064a\\u0636\\u0645\\u0646 \\u062a\\u062d\\u0642\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u0626\\u062c \\u0622\\u0645\\u0646\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0641\\u0639\\u0651\\u0627\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0643\\u0644\\u064d \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u063a\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644.<\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Pediatric congenital heart repairs.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0625\\u0635\\u0644\\u0627\\u062d\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u064e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Complex congenital hybrid procedure\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0647\\u062c\\u064a\\u0646\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"ECMO and advanced perfusion interventions.\",\"ar\":\"\\u062f\\u0639\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u064a\\u0627\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u062e\\u062f\\u0627\\u0645 ECMO.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"AI surveillance on hear lung machines\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u062e\\u062f\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u0643\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u0635\\u0637\\u0646\\u0627\\u0639\\u064a \\u0641\\u064a \\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0642\\u0628\\u0629 \\u0623\\u062c\\u0647\\u0632\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0626\\u0629.\"}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department\",\"ar\":\"\\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":78,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a\"}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\"},\"doctors\":[]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Documented high survival and recovery rates.\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u062d\\u0642\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0645\\u0639\\u062f\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u0631\\u062a\\u0641\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0646\\u062c\\u0627\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0641\\u064a.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Annual increase in surgical volume and success.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0632\\u064a\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0633\\u0646\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0639\\u062f\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u0648\\u0646\\u0633\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u062c\\u0627\\u062d.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Live case broadcasting for global medical education.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0628\\u062b \\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0628\\u0627\\u0634\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0623\\u063a\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u062a\\u0639\\u0644\\u064a\\u0645\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u064a\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Participation in international humanitarian medical missions.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u0643\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0628\\u0639\\u062b\\u0627\\u062a \\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0625\\u0646\\u0633\\u0627\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062f\\u0648\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Recognition for innovation in perfusion and surgical techniques.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0645\\u064a\\u0632 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u0628\\u062a\\u0643\\u0627\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u064a \\u0648\\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0631\\u0648\\u0627\\u0621.\"}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Outreach Clinical programs to expand access to surgical care.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645\\u062c \\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u064a\\u062f\\u0627\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062a\\u0647\\u062f\\u0641 \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u062a\\u0648\\u0633\\u064a\\u0639 \\u0641\\u0631\\u0635 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0635\\u0648\\u0644 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u064a\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Hands-on training workshops.\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0646\\u0638\\u064a\\u0645 \\u0648\\u0631\\u0634 \\u0639\\u0645\\u0644 \\u062a\\u062f\\u0631\\u064a\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062a\\u062e\\u0635\\u0635\\u0629.\"}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-02-10 16:59:24'),
(21, '{\"en\":\"Diagnostic & Interventional Radiology \",\"ar\":\"قسم الاشعة التداخلية والتشخيصية\"}', 16, '{\"en\":\"<p>The Radiology Department at AL NAS Hospital serves as a cornerstone of diagnostic excellence, providing advanced imaging services that support precise clinical decision-making across all medical specialties. Through state-of-the-art technology and expert interpretation, the department ensures timely, accurate, and patient-centered diagnostic care for infants and adults alike while keeping patient safety.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>يُعد قسم الأشعة بمستشفى الناس أحد الركائز الأساسية للتميز التشخيصي، حيث يقدّم خدمات تصوير طبي متقدمة تدعم اتخاذ القرارات الإكلينيكية الدقيقة في مختلف التخصصات الطبية. ومن خلال الاعتماد على أحدث التقنيات الطبية وخبرة الكوادر المتخصصة، يحرص القسم على توفير تشخيص دقيق وسريع يراعي سلامة المرضى، سواء من الأطفال أو البالغين، مع التركيز على الرعاية الطبية المتمحورة حول المريض.</p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Radiology at Al Nas Hospital supports every clinical department—from cardiology and cardiothoracic surgery to GIT and general patient radiological services—by providing essential imaging that guides diagnosis, surgical planning, and post-treatment assessment. The department operates 24/7 to respond to emergency cases and inpatient needs with excellence and reliability.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Ultrasound (US):</strong> Real-time imaging for soft tissue, abdomen, joints and cardiac evaluations.</p></li><li><p><strong>X-ray:</strong> Rapid and fundamental imaging for bones, chest, and trauma cases.</p></li><li><p><strong>MRI:</strong> High-resolution imaging for complex neurological, cardiac, and musculoskeletal conditions.</p></li><li><p><strong>CT Scan:</strong> Detailed cross-sectional imaging, with or without contrast, supporting complex surgical and diagnostic requirements.</p></li><li><p><strong>Doppler Studies: </strong>Vascular assessments that aid cardiologists and surgeons in evaluating blood flow and vessel conditions.</p></li></ul>\",\"ar\":\"<p>يدعم قسم الأشعة بمستشفى الناس جميع الأقسام الإكلينيكية، بدءًا من أمراض القلب وجراحة القلب والصدر، مرورًا بالجهاز الهضمي، ووصولًا إلى الخدمات الإشعاعية العامة  تؤدي كل خدمة تصوير دورًا تشخيصيًا محددًا، على النحو التالي:</p><p>·         <strong>الموجات فوق الصوتية (US):</strong> تصوير فوري للأنسجة الرخوة، والبطن، والمفاصل، وتقييمات القلب.</p><p>·         <strong>الأشعة السينية (X-ray):</strong> فحوصات سريعة وأساسية للعظام، والصدر، وحالات الطوارئ والإصابات.</p><p>·         <strong>الرنين المغناطيسي (MRI):</strong> تصوير عالي الدقة للحالات العصبية، والقلبية، والعضلية الهيكلية المعقدة.</p><p>·         <strong>الأشعة المقطعية (CT):</strong> تصوير مقطعي تفصيلي بالصبغة أو بدونها لدعم التشخيصات الدقيقة والتخطيط الجراحي.</p><p>·         <strong>فحوصات الدوبلر:</strong> تقييم الأوعية الدموية وتدفق الدم لدعم قرارات أطباء القلب والجراحين.للمرضى. ويعمل القسم على مدار 24 ساعة يوميًا لتلبية احتياجات الحالات الطارئة والمنومين بكفاءة وموثوقية عالية.</p>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"What we diagnose?\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0649 \\u064a\\u062a\\u0645 \\u062a\\u0634\\u062e\\u064a\\u0635\\u0647\\u0627 \"},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p>The department assists in diagnosing a wide range of conditions\\u2014from congenital anomalies and cardiovascular disorders to neurological, musculoskeletal, and abdominal diseases. Imaging plays a critical role in both acute care and long-term management of complex pediatric and adult cases.<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>\\u064a\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645 \\u0641\\u064a \\u062a\\u0634\\u062e\\u064a\\u0635 \\u0637\\u064a\\u0641 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0633\\u0639 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u062a\\u0634\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0650\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0648\\u0639\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0635\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0636\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0647\\u064a\\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0637\\u0646. \\u0648\\u062a\\u0645\\u062b\\u0644 \\u062e\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0635\\u0648\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0639\\u0646\\u0635\\u0631\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0623\\u0633\\u0627\\u0633\\u064a\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0627\\u062c\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062a\\u0627\\u0628\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0637\\u0648\\u064a\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062f\\u0649 \\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u063a\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629.<\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"The department assists in diagnosing a wide range of conditions from congenital anomalies and cardiovascular disorders to neurological, musculoskeletal, and abdominal diseases. Imaging plays a critical role in both acute care and long-term management of complex pediatric and adult cases.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645 \\u064a\\u0633\\u0627\\u0647\\u0645 \\u0641\\u064a \\u062a\\u0634\\u062e\\u064a\\u0635 \\u0645\\u062c\\u0645\\u0648\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0633\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0628\\u062f\\u0621\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0650\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0636\\u0637\\u0631\\u0627\\u0628\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0648\\u0639\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u0635\\u0648\\u0644\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0635\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0636\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0647\\u064a\\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0637\\u0646. \\u0648\\u062a\\u064f\\u0639\\u062f \\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0635\\u0648\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a \\u0639\\u0646\\u0635\\u0631\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0623\\u0633\\u0627\\u0633\\u064a\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0641\\u064a \\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u064a\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0627\\u062c\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062a\\u0627\\u0628\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0637\\u0648\\u064a\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062f\\u0649 \\u0644\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062f\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u063a\\u064a\\u0646.\"}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department \",\"ar\":\"\\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":79,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u0649\"}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":42,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u0649\"}}]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":\"88 ar\"}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Regular updates include the introduction of new imaging technologies, software upgrades, staff training milestones, and publications. The department also shares highlights on collaborative research achievements and community outreach programs related to radiologic awareness.\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0634\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u062d\\u062f\\u064a\\u062b\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0648\\u0631\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0625\\u062f\\u062e\\u0627\\u0644 \\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u062a\\u0635\\u0648\\u064a\\u0631 \\u062d\\u062f\\u064a\\u062b\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u062a\\u0631\\u0642\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0631\\u0645\\u062c\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a\\u060c \\u0648\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0644 \\u062a\\u062f\\u0631\\u064a\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0648\\u0627\\u062f\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u062c\\u0627\\u0646\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0635\\u062f\\u0627\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0644\\u0645\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0646\\u0634\\u0648\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a. \\u0643\\u0645\\u0627 \\u064a\\u0633\\u0644\\u0651\\u0637 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0636\\u0648\\u0621 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0623\\u0628\\u0631\\u0632 \\u0625\\u0646\\u062c\\u0627\\u0632\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0628\\u062d\\u0627\\u062b \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0648\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u0643\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062c\\u062a\\u0645\\u0639\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u062a\\u0628\\u0637\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0646\\u0634\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0639\\u064a \\u0628\\u0645\\u062c\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0634\\u0639\\u0629.\"}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-02-14 02:15:53'),
(22, '{\"en\":\"Physical Medicine & Rehabilitation \",\"ar\":\"العلاج الطبيعى وإعادة التأهيل\"}', 26, '{\"en\":\"<p>The Physical Medicine &amp; Rehabilitation Department at AL NAS Hospital is a comprehensive center dedicated to restoring function, reducing pain, and improving the quality of life for patients across all age groups. The department integrates evidence-based rehabilitation protocols with advanced therapeutic technologies to address musculoskeletal, neurological, cardiopulmonary, and post-surgical conditions. Our mission is to promote functional independence, accelerate recovery, and support long-term well-being through individualized, patient-centered care.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>يُعد قسم العلاج الطبيعي وإعادة التأهيل بمستشفى الناس مركزًا متكاملًا يهدف إلى استعادة القدرات الوظيفية، وتخفيف الألم، وتحسين جودة الحياة للمرضى من مختلف الفئات العمرية. ويعتمد القسم على بروتوكولات إعادة تأهيل قائمة على الأدلة العلمية، إلى جانب أحدث التقنيات العلاجية، للتعامل مع مجموعة واسعة من الحالات العضلية الهيكلية، والعصبية، والقلبية الرئوية، وحالات ما بعد الجراحات. وتتمثل رسالتنا في تعزيز الاستقلال الوظيفي، وتسريع عملية التعافي، ودعم الصحة والعافية على المدى الطويل من خلال رعاية فردية تتمحور حول المريض.</p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>The Physical Medicine &amp; Rehabilitation Department provides a full spectrum of preventive, therapeutic, and rehabilitative care. Patients with acute injuries, chronic conditions, congenital disorders, or post-surgical needs benefit from tailored treatment plans that combine manual therapy, exercise prescription, electrotherapy, and advanced rehabilitation modalities.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Orthopedic &amp; Musculoskeletal Rehabilitation: </strong>Focuses on recovery after fractures, joint replacement, and spine disorders, using advanced exercise therapy, manual techniques, and pain management protocols.</p></li><li><p><strong>Neurological Rehabilitation: </strong>Provides comprehensive programs for stroke, spinal cord injury, and neurodegenerative conditions, emphasizing motor recovery, balance, and functional independence.</p></li><li><p><strong>Cardiopulmonary Rehabilitation: </strong>Delivers structured exercise and breathing therapy for post-cardiac surgery patients, heart failure, COPD, and other chronic respiratory diseases to enhance endurance and functional capacity.</p></li><li><p><strong>Pediatric &amp; Developmental Rehabilitation: </strong>Offers early intervention and long-term therapy for children with cerebral palsy, congenital deformities, and developmental delays, supporting motor, cognitive, and social milestones.</p></li><li><p><strong>Sports Medicine &amp; Injury Recovery: </strong>Specializes in rehabilitation of acute and chronic sports injuries, preventive training, and performance optimization, ensuring safe and efficient return-to-play.</p></li><li><p><strong>Post-Operative &amp; Critical Care Rehabilitation: </strong>Provides early mobilization, respiratory physiotherapy, and functional recovery plans for patients in ICU and surgical wards, reducing complications and length of stay.</p></li><li><p><strong>Outpatient Physiotherapy Services: </strong>Caters to patients with chronic pain, workplace injuries, and lifestyle-related disorders, with personalized rehabilitation programs, ergonomic guidance, and long-term follow-up.</p></li></ul>\",\"ar\":\"<p>يوفّر قسم الطب الطبيعي وإعادة التأهيل مجموعة متكاملة من خدمات الرعاية الوقائية والعلاجية وإعادة التأهيل. ويستفيد المرضى الذين يعانون من إصابات حادة، أو حالات مزمنة، أو اضطرابات خلقية، أو احتياجات ما بعد الجراحات من خطط علاجية مصممة خصيصًا، تجمع بين العلاج اليدوي، ووصف التمارين العلاجية، والعلاج الكهربي، وتقنيات إعادة التأهيل المتقدمة.</p><p><strong>إعادة التأهيل العظمي والعضلي الهيكلي:</strong><br>يركّز على التعافي بعد الكسور، وجراحات استبدال المفاصل، واضطرابات العمود الفقري، من خلال برامج متقدمة للعلاج الحركي، وتقنيات العلاج اليدوي، وبروتوكولات متخصصة لإدارة الألم.</p><p><strong>إعادة التأهيل العصبي:</strong><br>يقدّم برامج شاملة لمرضى السكتات الدماغية، وإصابات الحبل الشوكي، والأمراض العصبية التنكسية، مع التركيز على استعادة الحركة، وتحسين التوازن، وتعزيز الاستقلال الوظيفي.</p><p><strong>إعادة التأهيل القلبي الرئوي:</strong><br>يوفّر برامج منظمة للتمارين والعلاج التنفسي لمرضى ما بعد جراحات القلب، وفشل القلب، ومرض الانسداد الرئوي المزمن (COPD)، وغيرها من أمراض الجهاز التنفسي المزمنة، بهدف تحسين القدرة على التحمل والكفاءة الوظيفية.</p><p><strong>إعادة تأهيل الأطفال والنمو:</strong><br>يقدّم خدمات التدخل المبكر والعلاج طويل المدى للأطفال المصابين بالشلل الدماغي، والتشوهات الخلقية، وتأخر النمو، مع دعم التطور الحركي والمعرفي والاجتماعي.</p><p><strong>طب الرياضة والتعافي من الإصابات:</strong><br>يختص بإعادة تأهيل الإصابات الرياضية الحادة والمزمنة، وبرامج الوقاية من الإصابات، وتحسين الأداء البدني، بما يضمن عودة آمنة وفعّالة إلى ممارسة النشاط الرياضي.</p><p><strong>إعادة التأهيل بعد العمليات الجراحية والرعاية الحرجة:</strong><br>يوفّر برامج التعبئة المبكرة، والعلاج الطبيعي التنفسي، وخطط التعافي الوظيفي لمرضى وحدات العناية المركزة وأقسام الجراحة، بما يسهم في تقليل المضاعفات وفترة الإقامة بالمستشفى.</p><p><strong>خدمات العلاج الطبيعي للعيادات الخارجية:</strong><br>تخدم المرضى الذين يعانون من الآلام المزمنة، وإصابات العمل، والاضطرابات المرتبطة بنمط الحياة، من خلال برامج تأهيل فردية، وإرشادات بيئية ووظيفية، ومتابعة طويلة المدى.</p>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"What we treat\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0649 \\u064a\\u062a\\u0645 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c\\u0647\\u0627\"},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p>At AL NAS Hospital\\u2019s Physical Medicine &amp; Rehabilitation Department, we support patients with a wide range of conditions that affect movement, function, and daily independence, including:<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p><\\/p><p>\\u0641\\u064a \\u0642\\u0633\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0639\\u064a \\u0648\\u0625\\u0639\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0623\\u0647\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0628\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0641\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633\\u060c \\u0646\\u0648\\u0641\\u0651\\u0631 \\u0631\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062a\\u0643\\u0627\\u0645\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0635\\u0627\\u0628\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0628\\u0637\\u064a\\u0641 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0633\\u0639 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u064a \\u062a\\u0624\\u062b\\u0631 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u062f\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0631\\u0643\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0638\\u0627\\u0626\\u0641 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0633\\u062f\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0642\\u0644\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0638\\u064a\\u0641\\u064a \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0646\\u0634\\u0637\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0648\\u0645\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u062a\\u0634\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0633\\u0628\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062b\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0644\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0635\\u0631:<\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Stroke, spinal cord injuries, and neuromuscular diseases\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0643\\u062a\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u063a\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u0625\\u0635\\u0627\\u0628\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0628\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0648\\u0643\\u064a\\u060c \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0635\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0636\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Post-arthroplasty and post-fracture rehabilitation\",\"ar\":\"\\u0625\\u0639\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0623\\u0647\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0628\\u062f\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0641\\u0627\\u0635\\u0644\\u060c \\u0648\\u0625\\u0639\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0623\\u0647\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0633\\u0648\\u0631\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Chronic pain syndromes and degenerative joint diseases\",\"ar\":\"\\u0645\\u062a\\u0644\\u0627\\u0632\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0644\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0632\\u0645\\u0646\\u060c \\u0648\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0641\\u0627\\u0635\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0646\\u0643\\u0633\\u064a\\u0629\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Congenital and developmental pediatric conditions\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0650\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0636\\u0637\\u0631\\u0627\\u0628\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0645\\u0648 \\u0644\\u062f\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Cardiac and pulmonary rehabilitation needs\",\"ar\":\"\\u0625\\u0639\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0623\\u0647\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0626\\u0648\\u064a\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Sports-related injuries and complex trauma recovery\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0635\\u0627\\u0628\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u064a\\u0627\\u0636\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0641\\u064a \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0635\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629\"}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department\",\"ar\":\"\\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":60,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u0649\"}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":60,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Associate Consultant \",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u0649 \\u0645\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u062f\"}}]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Successful integration of early mobilization protocols in ICU, reducing ventilator days and improving survival outcomes.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u062c\\u0627\\u062d \\u0641\\u064a \\u062a\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0628\\u0631\\u0648\\u062a\\u0648\\u0643\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0628\\u0626\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0628\\u0643\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0648\\u062d\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0646\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0643\\u0632\\u0629\\u060c \\u0645\\u0645\\u0627 \\u0623\\u0633\\u0647\\u0645 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0641\\u0636 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u064a\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u062e\\u062f\\u0627\\u0645 \\u062c\\u0647\\u0627\\u0632 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0646\\u0641\\u0633 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0635\\u0646\\u0627\\u0639\\u064a \\u0648\\u062a\\u062d\\u0633\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0639\\u062f\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0646\\u0642\\u0627\\u0630 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u064a\\u0627\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Established post-stroke rehabilitation pathways with documented functional independence improvement rates.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0648\\u0636\\u0639 \\u0645\\u0633\\u0627\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u0625\\u0639\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0623\\u0647\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0643\\u062a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u063a\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0639 \\u062a\\u0648\\u062b\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0645\\u0639\\u062f\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u062a\\u062d\\u0633\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0642\\u0644\\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0638\\u064a\\u0641\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062f\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"High success rates in restoring mobility post-orthopedic surgery, with outcomes comparable to international benchmarks.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0645\\u0639\\u062f\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0646\\u062c\\u0627\\u062d \\u0645\\u0631\\u062a\\u0641\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u062f\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0631\\u0643\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0638\\u0645\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0645\\u0639 \\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u0626\\u062c \\u062a\\u064f\\u0636\\u0627\\u0647\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0648\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Expansion of pediatric rehabilitation programs supporting children with cerebral palsy and developmental delays.\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0648\\u0633\\u064a\\u0639 \\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645\\u062c \\u0625\\u0639\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0623\\u0647\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0644\\u062f\\u0639\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0635\\u0627\\u0628\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0644\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u063a\\u064a \\u0648\\u062a\\u0623\\u062e\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0645\\u0648.\"}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Ongoing participation in multicenter research studies on neuroplasticity and recovery outcomes in stroke patients.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u0643\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0645\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u062f\\u0631\\u0627\\u0633\\u0627\\u062a \\u0628\\u062d\\u062b\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062a\\u0639\\u062f\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0643\\u0632 \\u062d\\u0648\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0644\\u062f\\u0648\\u0646\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0635\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u0626\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0641\\u064a \\u0644\\u062f\\u0649 \\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0643\\u062a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u063a\\u064a\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Annual physiotherapy workshops and advanced rehabilitation training courses.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0648\\u0631\\u0634 \\u0639\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0633\\u0646\\u0648\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0639\\u064a \\u0648\\u062f\\u0648\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u062a\\u062f\\u0631\\u064a\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0625\\u0639\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0623\\u0647\\u064a\\u0644.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Fellowship programs in musculoskeletal, cardiopulmonary, and neurological physiotherapy.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0632\\u0645\\u0627\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0639\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0636\\u0644\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0647\\u064a\\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u060c \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0626\\u0648\\u064a\\u060c \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0635\\u0628\\u064a.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Published research in national and international rehabilitation journals.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0646\\u0634\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0628\\u062d\\u0627\\u062b \\u0641\\u064a \\u0645\\u062c\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0625\\u0639\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0623\\u0647\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062d\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0648\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629.\"}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-02-14 02:49:17');
INSERT INTO `department_sections` (`id`, `title`, `department_id`, `overview`, `scope_of_unit`, `what_we_treat`, `leadership`, `achievements`, `news`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(23, '{\"en\":\"Adult Intensive Care Unit\",\"ar\":\"وحدة العناية المركزة للكبار\"}', 20, '{\"en\":\"<p>The Adult Intensive Care Unit (AICU) at Al Nas Hospital is a specialized unit designed to provide advanced, round-the-clock care for critically ill adult patients. Equipped with state-of-the-art monitoring and life-support systems, the AICU offers comprehensive management for patients with life-threatening medical and surgical conditions, including those requiring intensive postoperative care after complex cardiac, gastrointestinal, and liver transplant surgeries.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>تُعد وحدة العناية المركزة للكبار (AICU) بمستشفى الناس وحدة متخصصة لتقديم رعاية طبية متقدمة على مدار الساعة للمرضى البالغين ذوي الحالات الحرجة. وتضم الوحدة أحدث أنظمة المراقبة والدعم الحيوي، وتوفر رعاية شاملة للحالات الطبية والجراحية المهدِّدة للحياة، بما في ذلك الرعاية المركزة بعد العمليات الجراحية الكبرى مثل جراحات القلب والجهاز الهضمي وزراعة الكبد.</p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>The AICU delivers a full spectrum of intensive care services, from invasive and non-invasive monitoring to advanced ventilatory and hemodynamic support. Special attention is given to managing postoperative  high-risk patients, acute metabolic crises such as diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA), and multi-organ failure. The unit’s mission is to ensure patient safety, optimize recovery, and support comprehensive multidisciplinary care for critically ill adults.</p><h3>Specialized Procedures and Functions</h3><ul><li><p>Advanced hemodynamic monitoring and stabilization</p></li><li><p>Post-cardiac surgery care (open-heart procedures, valve replacements, complex adult congenital heart surgeries )</p></li><li><p>Post-liver transplantation care, including graft monitoring and immunosuppression management</p></li><li><p>Post-GIT surgery care, including management of complications and nutritional support</p></li><li><p>Management of diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA) and other acute metabolic crises</p></li><li><p>Mechanical ventilation (invasive and non-invasive) for respiratory failure</p></li><li><p>Renal replacement therapy (intermittent hemodialysis and CRRT) for acute kidney injury</p></li><li><p>Sepsis management and multi-organ support</p></li><li><p>Neurological monitoring and postoperative intensive care</p></li><li><p>rapid response team and ICU outreach for very ill patients outside of the ICU</p></li></ul>\",\"ar\":\"<p>تقدّم الوحدة مجموعة متكاملة من خدمات العناية المركزة، تشمل المراقبة التداخلية وغير التداخلية، والدعم المتقدم للتنفس والدورة الدموية. ونولى اهتماما خاصا بالمرضى بعد الجراحة ولا سيما للحالات الأكثر تعقيدا، وحالات الأزمات الأيضية الحادة مثل الحماض الكيتوني السكري (DKA)، وفشل الأعضاء المتعدد. وتهدف الوحدة إلى ضمان سلامة المرضى، وتسريع التعافي، وتقديم رعاية شاملة متعددة التخصصات للبالغين في الحالات الحرجة.</p><h3>الإجراءات والوظائف المتخصصة</h3><ul><li><p>المراقبة المتقدمة للدورة الدموية وتثبيت الحالة</p></li><li><p>رعاية ما بعد جراحات القلب (جراحات القلب المفتوح، تغيير الصمامات، وجراحات عيوب القلب الخَلقية المعقدة لدى البالغين)</p></li><li><p>رعاية ما بعد زراعة الكبد، بما يشمل متابعة الكبد المزروع وإدارة العلاج المثبط للمناعة</p></li><li><p>رعاية ما بعد جراحات الجهاز الهضمي، وإدارة المضاعفات والدعم الغذائي</p></li><li><p>علاج الحماض الكيتوني السكري (DKA) والأزمات الأيضية الحادة الأخرى</p></li><li><p>التهوية الميكانيكية (الغازية وغير الغازية) لحالات الفشل التنفسي</p></li><li><p>العلاج التعويضي للكلى (الغسيل الكلوي المتقطع والعلاج المستمر CRRT) لحالات الفشل الكلوي الحاد</p></li><li><p>علاج حالات الإنتان (Sepsis) ودعم الأعضاء المتعددة</p></li><li><p>المراقبة العصبية والرعاية المركزة بعد الجراحات العصبية</p></li><li><p>فريق الاستجابة السريعة وخدمات متابعة مرضى الحالات الحرجة خارج وحدة العناية المركزة</p></li></ul>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"What we treat\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0649 \\u064a\\u062a\\u0645 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c\\u0647\\u0627\"},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p>At AL NAS Hospital\\u2019s Adult Intensive Care Unit (AICU), we provide advanced, round-the-clock care for critically ill adult patients with complex medical and surgical conditions, including:<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>\\u0641\\u064a \\u0648\\u062d\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0646\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0643\\u0632\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u063a\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0628\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0641\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633 (AICU)\\u060c \\u0646\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645 \\u0631\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0645\\u062f\\u0627\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u063a\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0630\\u0648\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0631\\u062c\\u0629\\u060c \\u0645\\u0645\\u0646 \\u064a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0646\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0623\\u0648 \\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u062a\\u0634\\u0645\\u0644:<\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Postoperative recovery following cardiac, liver transplant, and gastrointestinal surgeries\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0641\\u064a \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0648\\u0632\\u0631\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0628\\u062f \\u0648\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0647\\u0627\\u0632 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0647\\u0636\\u0645\\u064a\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Advanced heart failure and cardiac catheterization patients requiring level 2 and 3 intensive care\",\"ar\":\"\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0641\\u0634\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645 \\u0648\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0637\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u064a\\u0646 \\u064a\\u062d\\u062a\\u0627\\u062c\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0631\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0631\\u0643\\u0632\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0648\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062b\\u0627\\u0646\\u064a \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062b\\u0627\\u0644\\u062b\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Acute metabolic conditions such as DKA\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u064a\\u0636\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062b\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0645\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u064a\\u062a\\u0648\\u0646\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0643\\u0631\\u064a (DKA)\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Acute respiratory failure and ARDS\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0634\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0646\\u0641\\u0633\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u062f \\u0648\\u0645\\u062a\\u0644\\u0627\\u0632\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0636\\u0627\\u0626\\u0642\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0646\\u0641\\u0633\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 (ARDS)\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Severe infections and septic shock\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u062f\\u0648\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u062f\\u064a\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0635\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Multi-organ dysfunction requiring advanced support\",\"ar\":\"\\u0641\\u0634\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0639\\u0636\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062a\\u0639\\u062f\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u064a \\u064a\\u062a\\u0637\\u0644\\u0628 \\u062f\\u0639\\u0645\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u064b\\u0627\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Neurological emergencies and post-surgical monitoring\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0648\\u0627\\u0631\\u0626 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0635\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062a\\u0627\\u0628\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0627\\u062a\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Emergency surgical cases requiring intensive support\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0627\\u0631\\u0626\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u064a \\u062a\\u062d\\u062a\\u0627\\u062c \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u062f\\u0639\\u0645 \\u0645\\u0643\\u062b\\u0641\"}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department\",\"ar\":\"\\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":20,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a\"}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\"},\"doctors\":[]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"The AICU has successfully supported some of the most complex and high-risk cases at Al Nas Hospital. From stabilizing patients after cardiac surgery and liver transplantation to managing life-threatening conditions such as DKA and sepsis, the unit has consistently delivered excellent outcomes, allowing patients to transition safely from critical illness to recovery.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0646\\u062c\\u062d\\u062a \\u0648\\u062d\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0646\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0643\\u0632\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0643\\u0628\\u0627\\u0631 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0645\\u0639 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u062f\\u064a\\u062f \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0637\\u0648\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0641\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633. \\u0641\\u0642\\u062f \\u0623\\u0633\\u0647\\u0645\\u062a \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0642\\u0631\\u0627\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0648\\u0632\\u0631\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0628\\u062f\\u060c \\u0648\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c \\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u0647\\u062f\\u0651\\u0650\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u062d\\u064a\\u0627\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062b\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0645\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u064a\\u062a\\u0648\\u0646\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0643\\u0631\\u064a \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u0646\\u060c \\u0645\\u062d\\u0642\\u0642\\u0629 \\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u0626\\u062c \\u0645\\u062a\\u0645\\u064a\\u0632\\u0629 \\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u062f\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u0646\\u062a\\u0642\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0622\\u0645\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0631\\u062d\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0637\\u0631 \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0641\\u064a.\"}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Expansion of post-transplant monitoring protocols\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0648\\u0633\\u064a\\u0639 \\u0628\\u0631\\u0648\\u062a\\u0648\\u0643\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u062a\\u0627\\u0628\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0645\\u0627 \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u0632\\u0631\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0639\\u0636\\u0627\\u0621\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Introduction of standardized care pathways for DKA and metabolic emergencies\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0645\\u0633\\u0627\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u0631\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0648\\u062d\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0645\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u064a\\u062a\\u0648\\u0646\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0643\\u0631\\u064a \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0632\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u064a\\u0636\\u064a\\u0629\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Implementation of enhanced recovery protocols after cardiac surgeries\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0646\\u0641\\u064a\\u0630 \\u0628\\u0631\\u0648\\u062a\\u0648\\u0643\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0632\\u0651\\u064e\\u0632 \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Regular simulation workshops for cardiopulmonary resuscitation and postoperative complications\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0646\\u0638\\u064a\\u0645 \\u0648\\u0631\\u0634 \\u0645\\u062d\\u0627\\u0643\\u0627\\u0629 \\u062f\\u0648\\u0631\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0625\\u0646\\u0639\\u0627\\u0634 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0626\\u0648\\u064a \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0645\\u0639 \\u0645\\u0636\\u0627\\u0639\\u0641\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u0627 \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0629\"}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-02-14 02:50:16'),
(24, '{\"en\":\"Pediatric Intensive Care Unit\",\"ar\":\"وحدة القلب والعناية المركزة للأطفال\"}', 20, '{\"en\":\"<p>The Pediatric Intensive Care Unit (PICU) at Al Nas Hospital is a specialized service dedicated to the care of critically ill infants, children, and adolescents, with a strong focus on congenital and acquired cardiac conditions. The unit provides 24/7 advanced pediatric cardiac intensive care, supported by state-of-the-art monitoring and life-support systems to ensure precise, continuous assessment and timely intervention. Our multidisciplinary team manages complex pre- and postoperative congenital heart cases, as well as patients recovering from cardiac catheterization procedures, delivering coordinated, high-level care that prioritizes safety, recovery, and long-term outcomes.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>تُقدّم وحدة قلب الأطفال والرعاية المركزة للاطفال خدمات تشخيصية وتداخلية متقدمة لمرضى الأطفال المصابين بأمراض القلب الخَلقية والمعقدة. وتُعد الوحدة ركيزة أساسية في إجراء التدخلات المحدودة، بما يُسهم في تجنّب جراحات القلب المفتوح كلما أمكن ذلك.<br>كما توفر الوحدة خدمات متقدمة في تشخيص وعلاج اضطرابات نظم القلب والتوصيل الكهربي لدى الأطفال من خلال تقنيات الفيزيولوجيا الكهربية القلبية الحديثة.</p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Our unit delivers comprehensive, family-centered care for patients with complex congenital cardiac physiology, including single-ventricle and shunt-dependent circulation. Through close multidisciplinary collaboration, we focus on optimizing cardiac output and systemic perfusion, preventing and managing low cardiac output syndrome (LCOS), and providing advanced respiratory, renal, and multi-organ support to ensure safe stabilization, recovery, and long-term outcomes.</p><p><strong>Specialized Procedures and Functions:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Invasive and non-invasive hemodynamic monitoring (arterial line, CVP, NIRS, lactate)</p></li><li><p>Immediate postoperative care after congenital cardiac surgery</p></li><li><p>Management of shunt-dependent lesions (BT shunt, PDA-dependent CHD)</p></li><li><p>Care of single-ventricle physiology ( Glenn, Fontan)</p></li><li><p>Cardiac-tailored mechanical ventilation strategies</p></li><li><p>Pulmonary hypertension monitoring and crisis management</p></li><li><p>Inotropic and vasoactive drug support</p></li><li><p>Temporary pacing and arrhythmia management</p></li><li><p>Renal support including peritoneal dialysis and CRRT</p></li><li><p>Sepsis recognition and management in cardiac patients</p></li><li><p>Post–cardiac catheterization intensive monitoring</p></li><li><p>Rapid response for deteriorating cardiac patients</p></li></ul>\",\"ar\":\"<p>تعد وحدة العناية المركزة للأطفال (PICU) بمستشفى الناس خدمة متخصصة مكرسة لرعاية الرضع والأطفال والمراهقين في الحالات الحرجة، مع تركيز كبير على الحالات القلبية الخلقية والمكتسبة. توفّر الوحدة رعاية قلبية مركزة متقدمة على مدار الساعة، مدعومة بأحدث أنظمة المراقبة وأجهزة دعم الحياة لضمان تقييم مستمر ودقيق والتدخل الفوري عند الحاجة. يدير فريقنا متعدد التخصصات الحالات المعقدة قبل وبعد جراحة القلب، بالإضافة إلى المرضى الذين يتعافون من إجراءات القسطرة القلبية، مقدمًا رعاية منسقة وعالية المستوى تضع السلامة، والتعافي، والنتائج طويلة المدى في المقام الأول.</p><p><strong>الإجراءات والوظائف المتخصصة:</strong></p><ul><li><p>المراقبة الديناميكية الدموية الغازية وغير الغازية (خط شرياني، الضغط الوريدي المركزي CVP، NIRS، اللاكتات)</p></li><li><p>الرعاية الفورية بعد جراحة القلب الخلقية</p></li><li><p>إدارة العيوب القلبية المعتمدة على التحويلات (شنت BT، أمراض القلب الخلقية المعتمدة على PDA)</p></li><li><p>رعاية حالات البطين الواحد (Glenn، Fontan)</p></li><li><p>استراتيجيات التهوية الميكانيكية المخصصة للقلب</p></li><li><p>مراقبة ارتفاع ضغط الدم الرئوي وإدارة الأزمات</p></li><li><p>دعم الدواء المحفّز للقلب (Inotropic) والأدوية الوعائية (Vasoactive)</p></li><li><p>تنظيم ضربات القلب المؤقت وإدارة اضطرابات النظم</p></li><li><p>دعم الكلى بما في ذلك غسيل البطن المستمر وCRRT</p></li><li><p>التعرف على العدوى (Sepsis) وإدارتها لدى المرضى القلبيين</p></li><li><p>مراقبة مكثفة بعد إجراءات القسطرة القلبية</p></li><li><p>الاستجابة السريعة لمرضى القلب ممن تتدهور حالتهم سريريا</p></li></ul>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"What we treat\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0649 \\u064a\\u062a\\u0645 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c\\u0647\\u0627\"},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p>At Al Nas Hospital\\u2019s Pediatric Cardiac Intensive Care Unit (PICU), we provide specialized, round-the-clock care for critically ill children with complex congenital and acquired heart conditions, including:<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: end;\\\">\\u0641\\u064a \\u0648\\u062d\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0646\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0643\\u0632\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644 (PICU) \\u0628\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0641\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633\\u060c \\u0646\\u0648\\u0641\\u0631 \\u0631\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062a\\u062e\\u0635\\u0635\\u0629 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0645\\u062f\\u0627\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0631\\u062c\\u0629\\u060c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0635\\u0627\\u0628\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0628\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u062e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0623\\u0648 \\u0645\\u0643\\u062a\\u0633\\u0628\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u060c \\u0648\\u062a\\u0634\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0647\\u0630\\u0647 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a:<\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Congenital heart disease (cyanotic and acyanotic)\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Postoperative congenital cardiac surgery patients\",\"ar\":\"\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0647\\u064a \\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u0647\\u064a\\u0643\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0645\\u0648\\u062c\\u0648\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0646\\u0630 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u062a\\u0646\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645 \\u0628\\u0634\\u0643\\u0644 \\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633\\u064a \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0645\\u0632\\u0631\\u0642\\u0629 (\\u0646\\u0642\\u0635 \\u0623\\u0643\\u0633\\u062c\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645\\/\\u0632\\u0631\\u0642\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0644\\u062f) \\u0646\\u062a\\u064a\\u062c\\u0629 \\u062a\\u062d\\u0648\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645 \\u063a\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0624\\u0643\\u0633\\u062f \\u0644\\u0644\\u062c\\u0633\\u0645\\u060c \\u0648\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u063a\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0645\\u0632\\u0631\\u0642\\u0629 (\\u0623\\u0643\\u0633\\u062c\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0639\\u064a\\/\\u062a\\u062d\\u0648\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0633\\u0627\\u0631 \\u0644\\u0644\\u064a\\u0645\\u064a\\u0646).\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Post\\u2013cardiac catheterization complications\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0636\\u0627\\u0639\\u0641\\u0627\\u062a \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u0625\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0637\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Low cardiac output syndrome\",\"ar\":\"\\u0645\\u062a\\u0644\\u0627\\u0632\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0646\\u062e\\u0641\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Pulmonary hypertension crises\",\"ar\":\"\\u0623\\u0632\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0631\\u062a\\u0641\\u0627\\u0639 \\u0636\\u063a\\u0637 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0626\\u0648\\u064a\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Acute heart failure and cardiogenic shock\",\"ar\":\"\\u0641\\u0634\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u062f \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0635\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Complex arrhythmias and conduction abnormalities\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0636\\u0637\\u0631\\u0627\\u0628\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0638\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Cardiac-related acute kidney injury\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0634\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0644\\u0648\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u062a\\u0628\\u0637 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Sepsis in children with underlying heart disease\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u0646 \\u0644\\u062f\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0635\\u0627\\u0628\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0628\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Emergency surgical cases in children with CHD\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0627\\u0631\\u0626\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062f\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0635\\u0627\\u0628\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0628\\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u062e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 (CHD)\"}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department\",\"ar\":\"\\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":24,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u0649\"}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\"},\"doctors\":[]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":\"88 ar\"}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Implementation of standardized postoperative congenital cardiac protocols\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0628\\u0631\\u0648\\u062a\\u0648\\u0643\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0642\\u064a\\u0627\\u0633\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0627 \\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Introduction of LCOS prevention and early detection bundles\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u064a\\u0645 \\u062d\\u0632\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0642\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0634\\u0641 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0628\\u0643\\u0631 \\u0644\\u0645\\u062a\\u0644\\u0627\\u0632\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0646\\u062e\\u0641\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a (LCOS)\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Regular multidisciplinary simulation programs\",\"ar\":\"\\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062d\\u0627\\u0643\\u0627\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062a\\u0639\\u062f\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u062e\\u0635\\u0635\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0648\\u0631\\u064a\\u0629\"}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-02-14 03:24:47'),
(25, '{\"en\":\"Neonatal Intensive Care Unit\",\"ar\":\"وحدة العناية المركزة لحديثي الولادة \"}', 20, '{\"en\":\"<p>The Neonatal Intensive Care Unit (NICU) at Al Nas Hospital is a highly specialized unit dedicated to the care of newborns requiring advanced medical and surgical support. Equipped with cutting-edge technology and staffed by expert neonatologists, pediatric intensivists, and neonatal nurses, the NICU provides life-saving care for critically ill infants, including those born with congenital heart disease or requiring surgery shortly after birth.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>تُعد وحدة العناية المركزة لحديثي الولادة (NICU) بمستشفى الناس وحدة متخصصة عالية المستوى، مكرّسة لرعاية المواليد الجدد الذين يحتاجون إلى دعم طبي وجراحي متقدم. وقد جُهّزت الوحدة بأحدث التقنيات الطبية، ويعمل بها نخبة من أطباء حديثي الولادة، وأطباء العناية المركزة للأطفال، وهيئة تمريض متخصصة، لتقديم رعاية منقذة للحياة للرضّع في الحالات الحرجة، بما في ذلك الأطفال المولودون بعيوب خلقية في القلب أو الذين يحتاجون إلى تدخلات جراحية في وقت مبكر بعد الولادة.</p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>The NICU has a total capacity of 48 incubators and is supported by a dedicated neonatal operating room, enabling timely surgical interventions without the need to transfer fragile infants. The unit provides comprehensive monitoring, respiratory support, and specialized care for neonates with complex cardiac medical and surgical needs. Services include post-cardiac intervention care via a well-formed NICU multidisciplinary protocol.</p><h3><strong>Specialized Procedures and Functions:</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Post-cardiac surgery intensive care for neonates with congenital heart disease</p></li><li><p>Advanced respiratory support (high-frequency ventilation, CPAP, and surfactant therapy)</p></li><li><p>Hemodynamic monitoring and support with inotropes and advanced lines</p></li><li><p>Total parenteral nutrition (TPN) and specialized neonatal feeding support</p></li><li><p>On-site neonatal cardiac surgeries performed in the unit’s dedicated operating room</p></li></ul>\",\"ar\":\"<p>تضم وحدة NICU سعة إجمالية تبلغ 48 حضّانة، وتدعمها غرفة عمليات مخصصة لحديثي الولادة، ما يتيح التدخلات الجراحية في الوقت المناسب دون الحاجة إلى نقل الأطفال ذوي الحالات الحرجة خارج الوحدة. وتوفر الوحدة مراقبة شاملة، ودعماً تنفسياً متقدماً، ورعاية متخصصة لحديثي الولادة المصابين بأمراض قلبية معقدة، سواء الطبية أو الجراحية. وتشمل الخدمات رعاية ما بعد التدخلات القلبية وفق بروتوكول متعدد التخصصات مُعدّ بعناية داخل الوحدة.</p><h3><strong>الإجراءات والمهام المتخصصة</strong></h3><ul><li><p>العناية المركزة بعد جراحات القلب لحديثي الولادة المصابين بعيوب قلبية خلقية</p></li><li><p>الدعم التنفسي المتقدم (التهوية عالية التردد، ضغط المجرى الهوائي الإيجابي المستمر CPAP، والعلاج بمادة السرفاكتنت)</p></li><li><p>مراقبة ودعم الديناميكا الدموية باستخدام الأدوية المقوية لانقباض القلب والخطوط المتقدمة</p></li><li><p>التغذية الوريدية الكاملة (TPN) وبرامج التغذية المتخصصة لحديثي الولادة</p></li><li><p>إجراء جراحات القلب لحديثي الولادة داخل غرفة العمليات المخصصة للوحدة</p></li></ul>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"What we treat\",\"ar\":\"\\u0645\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u064a \\u0646\\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0647\\u061f\"},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p>At Al Nas Hospital\\u2019s Neonatal Intensive Care Unit (NICU), we provide specialized, round-the-clock care for newborns with complex congenital and acquired conditions, including those requiring advanced medical support, cardiac intervention, and continuous monitoring, including:<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>\\u0641\\u064a \\u0648\\u062d\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0646\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0643\\u0632\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062d\\u062f\\u064a\\u062b\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0641\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633 (NICU)\\u060c \\u0646\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645 \\u0631\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062a\\u062e\\u0635\\u0635\\u0629 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0645\\u062f\\u0627\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062d\\u062f\\u064a\\u062b\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u064a\\u0646 \\u064a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0646\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u062e\\u0650\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0623\\u0648 \\u0645\\u0643\\u062a\\u0633\\u0628\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629\\u060c \\u0628\\u0645\\u0627 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0630\\u0644\\u0643 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u064a \\u062a\\u062a\\u0637\\u0644\\u0628 \\u062f\\u0639\\u0645\\u0627\\u064b \\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0627\\u064b \\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u064b\\u060c \\u0648\\u062a\\u062f\\u062e\\u0644\\u0627\\u064b \\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0627\\u064b\\u060c \\u0648\\u0645\\u062a\\u0627\\u0628\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0645\\u0631\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u062a\\u0634\\u0645\\u0644:<\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Neonates with congenital heart defects (pre- and post-surgery\\/ catheterization) \",\"ar\":\"\\u062d\\u062f\\u064a\\u062b\\u0648 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0635\\u0627\\u0628\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0628\\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u062e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 (\\u0642\\u0628\\u0644 \\u0648\\u0628\\u0639\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u0629 \\u0623\\u0648 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0637\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629)\"}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department\",\"ar\":\"\\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":26,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a\"}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":27,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Associate Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a \\u0645\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u062f\"}}]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"The NICU at Al Nas Hospital has been a lifeline for hundreds of newborns with complex congenital heart disease and surgical anomalies. With its 24 incubator capacity and in-unit operating rooms, the NICU has successfully treated many critically ill neonates without the risks of external transfer. Families have witnessed premature babies and infants with severe conditions recover and thrive, underscoring the NICU\\u2019s impact and excellence.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0645\\u062b\\u0651\\u0644\\u062a \\u0648\\u062d\\u062f\\u0629 NICU \\u0628\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0641\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633 \\u0634\\u0631\\u064a\\u0627\\u0646 \\u062d\\u064a\\u0627\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0645\\u0626\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u0646 \\u062d\\u062f\\u064a\\u062b\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0635\\u0627\\u0628\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0628\\u0639\\u064a\\u0648\\u0628 \\u062e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0639\\u0642\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0648\\u062a\\u0634\\u0648\\u0647\\u0627\\u062a \\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u064a\\u0629. \\u0648\\u0628\\u0641\\u0636\\u0644 \\u0633\\u0639\\u062a\\u0647\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u064a \\u062a\\u0636\\u0645 48 \\u062d\\u0636\\u0651\\u0627\\u0646\\u0629 \\u0648\\u063a\\u0631\\u0641 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u062f\\u0627\\u062e\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u062d\\u062f\\u0629\\u060c \\u0646\\u062c\\u062d\\u062a \\u0641\\u064a \\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u062f\\u064a\\u062f \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0631\\u062c\\u0629 \\u062f\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0645\\u062e\\u0627\\u0637\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0642\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0627\\u0631\\u062c\\u064a. \\u0648\\u0642\\u062f \\u0634\\u0647\\u062f\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0633\\u0631 \\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0641\\u064a \\u0648\\u0646\\u0645\\u0648 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0628\\u062a\\u0633\\u0631\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0636\\u0651\\u0639 \\u0630\\u0648\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u062f\\u064a\\u062f\\u0629\\u060c \\u0645\\u0627 \\u064a\\u0624\\u0643\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u062b\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u064a\\u062c\\u0627\\u0628\\u064a \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0645\\u064a\\u0651\\u0632 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u064a \\u062a\\u062d\\u0642\\u0642\\u0647 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u062d\\u062f\\u0629.\"}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Implementation of neonatal early-warning systems for high-risk infants\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0623\\u0646\\u0638\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0646\\u0630\\u0627\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0628\\u0643\\u0631 \\u0644\\u062d\\u062f\\u064a\\u062b\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0630\\u0648\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0637\\u0648\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Expansion of congenital heart screening programs in collaboration with national health initiatives\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0648\\u0633\\u0639 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645\\u062c \\u0641\\u062d\\u0635 \\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0639 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0628\\u0627\\u062f\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0635\\u062d\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0637\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Introduction of family-centered care models, allowing parents to actively participate in neonatal recovery\",\"ar\":\"\\u0625\\u062f\\u062e\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0646\\u0645\\u0627\\u0630\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u062a\\u0643\\u0632\\u0629 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0633\\u0631\\u0629\\u060c \\u0628\\u0645\\u0627 \\u064a\\u062a\\u064a\\u062d \\u0645\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u0643\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0639\\u0651\\u0627\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0631\\u062d\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0639\\u0627\\u0641\\u064a\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Ongoing workshops on neonatal resuscitation and advanced intensive care protocols\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0646\\u0638\\u064a\\u0645 \\u0648\\u0631\\u0634 \\u0639\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0645\\u0631\\u0629 \\u062d\\u0648\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0646\\u0639\\u0627\\u0634 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0644\\u064a\\u062f\\u064a \\u0648\\u0628\\u0631\\u0648\\u062a\\u0648\\u0643\\u0648\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0646\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0643\\u0632\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629\"}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-02-10 18:09:07'),
(26, '{\"en\":\"Laboratory \",\"ar\":\"قسم المعامل \"}', 21, '{\"en\":\"<p>The Laboratory Department at AL NAS Hospital is the backbone of accurate diagnosis and advanced patient care. By combining cutting-edge technology with highly skilled professionals, we provide precise, timely, and reliable laboratory services that support clinical decisions across all hospital specialties. Our laboratories are accredited and operate according to international quality standards, ensuring patient safety and excellence in every test performed.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>يُعد قسم المعامل بمستشفى الناس الركيزة الأساسية للتشخيص الدقيق وتقديم رعاية صحية متقدمة للمرضى. ومن خلال الدمج بين أحدث التقنيات الطبية والخبرات البشرية عالية الكفاءة، يقدّم القسم خدمات معملية دقيقة وسريعة وموثوقة تدعم اتخاذ القرار الطبي في مختلف التخصصات.<br>تعمل معامل مستشفى الناس وفقًا لأعلى معايير الجودة العالمية، وتحمل الاعتمادات اللازمة التي تضمن سلامة المرضى والتميز في جميع الفحوصات المعملية.</p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Our laboratory covers the full spectrum of diagnostic services, from routine blood tests to highly complex genetic and molecular studies. We serve inpatients, outpatients, emergency cases, and specialized clinical programs, making laboratory testing an integral part of patient management.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Hematology &amp; Coagulation</strong>: Complete blood counts, bone marrow studies, clotting factor analysis.</p></li><li><p><strong>Clinical Chemistry</strong>: Kidney and liver function tests, cardiac markers, metabolic panels, therapeutic drug monitoring.</p></li><li><p><strong>Microbiology</strong>: Culture and sensitivity testing, antimicrobial resistance monitoring, infection control support.</p></li><li><p><strong>Immunology &amp; Serology</strong>: Autoimmune disease testing, allergy testing, viral and bacterial serology.</p></li><li><p><strong>Histopathology &amp; Cytology</strong>: Biopsy analysis, tumor markers, cancer screening, frozen sections for surgeries.</p></li><li><p><strong>Molecular Diagnostics</strong>: PCR, genetic sequencing, hereditary disease testing, personalized medicine panels.</p></li><li><p><strong>Point-of-Care</strong>: Rapid bedside tests for critical parameters in ICUs, ER, and operating rooms.</p></li></ul>\",\"ar\":\"<p>يغطي قسم المعامل كافة الخدمات التشخيصية، بدءًا من التحاليل الروتينية وصولًا إلى الدراسات الجينية والجزيئية عالية التعقيد. ويخدم القسم المرضى الداخليين، ومرضى العيادات الخارجية، وحالات الطوارئ، بالإضافة إلى البرامج الإكلينيكية المتخصصة، ليكون جزءًا لا يتجزأ من منظومة الرعاية الصحية المتكاملة.</p><p>·        <strong>أمراض الدم والتجلط:</strong> صورة الدم الكاملة، دراسات نخاع العظام، تحاليل عوامل التجلط.</p><p>·        <strong>الكيمياء الإكلينيكية:</strong> وظائف الكلى والكبد، دلالات القلب، تحاليل التمثيل الغذائي، متابعة مستويات الأدوية العلاجية.</p><p>·        <strong>الميكروبيولوجي:</strong> زراعة الميكروبات واختبارات الحساسية، متابعة مقاومة المضادات الحيوية، دعم برامج مكافحة العدوى.</p><p>·        <strong>المناعة والسيرولوجي:</strong> تشخيص أمراض المناعة الذاتية، اختبارات الحساسية، الفحوصات المصلية للفيروسات والبكتيريا.</p><p>·        <strong>الباثولوجيا النسيجية والخلوية:</strong> تحليل العينات النسيجية، دلالات الأورام، فحوصات الكشف المبكر عن السرطان، الفحص الفوري أثناء العمليات الجراحية.</p><p>·        <strong>التشخيص الجزيئي:</strong> اختبارات PCR، التسلسل الجيني، تشخيص الأمراض الوراثية، فحوصات الطب الشخصي.</p><p>·        <strong>الفحوصات السريرية السريعة:</strong> اختبارات فورية بجانب المريض في وحدات العناية المركزة والطوارئ وغرف العمليات.</p>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"What we treat\",\"ar\":\"\\u0645\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u064a \\u0646\\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0647\\u061f\"},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p>Our Laboratory delivers precise and timely diagnostic testing to support clinical decisions across all specialties, including:<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>\\u064a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0651\\u0645 \\u0645\\u062e\\u062a\\u0628\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0641\\u0649 \\u062e\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u062a\\u0634\\u062e\\u064a\\u0635\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062f\\u0642\\u064a\\u0642\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0642\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633\\u0628 \\u0644\\u062f\\u0639\\u0645 \\u0627\\u062a\\u062e\\u0627\\u0630 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0631\\u0627\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0639\\u0628\\u0631 \\u062c\\u0645\\u064a\\u0639 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u062e\\u0635\\u0635\\u0627\\u062a\\u060c \\u0648\\u062a\\u0634\\u0645\\u0644:<\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Congenital heart diseases and genetic syndromes.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062a\\u0644\\u0627\\u0632\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0631\\u0627\\u062b\\u064a\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Infectious diseases (bacterial, viral, fungal, parasitic).\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u062f\\u064a\\u0629 (\\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0643\\u062a\\u064a\\u0631\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u064a\\u0631\\u0648\\u0633\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0637\\u0631\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0641\\u064a\\u0644\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a).\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Autoimmune and immunodeficiency disorders.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0646\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u0627\\u062a\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0646\\u0642\\u0635 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0646\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Oncological conditions.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0648\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062e\\u062a\\u0644\\u0641\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Endocrine and metabolic diseases.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u063a\\u062f\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u0635\\u0645\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0645\\u062b\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u063a\\u0630\\u0627\\u0626\\u064a.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Hematological disorders including anemia, clotting disorders, and malignancies.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645\\u060c \\u0628\\u0645\\u0627 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0630\\u0644\\u0643 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0646\\u064a\\u0645\\u064a\\u0627 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0636\\u0637\\u0631\\u0627\\u0628\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u062c\\u0644\\u0637 \\u0648\\u0623\\u0648\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645.\"}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department\",\"ar\":\"\\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":40,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a\"}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":41,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Associate Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a \\u0645\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u062f\"}},{\"doctor\":39,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Associate Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a \\u0645\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u062f\"}}]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Pioneering genetic testing for congenital cardiac patients in Egypt.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u064a\\u0627\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0625\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u062d\\u0648\\u0635\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u064a\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0645\\u0635\\u0631.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"First in the region to implement a fully automated molecular diagnostic unit integrated with patient EMR.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0623\\u0648\\u0644 \\u0645\\u0639\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0646\\u0637\\u0642\\u0629 \\u064a\\u0637\\u0628\\u0642 \\u0648\\u062d\\u062f\\u0629 \\u062a\\u0634\\u062e\\u064a\\u0635 \\u062c\\u0632\\u064a\\u0626\\u064a \\u0645\\u0624\\u062a\\u0645\\u062a\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0627\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0648\\u0645\\u062a\\u0643\\u0627\\u0645\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0639 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u062c\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0644\\u0643\\u062a\\u0631\\u0648\\u0646\\u064a.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Recognition for rapid COVID-19 diagnostics during the pandemic.\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0643\\u0631\\u064a\\u0645 \\u0644\\u062f\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0633\\u0631\\u0639\\u0629 \\u062a\\u0634\\u062e\\u064a\\u0635 \\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0643\\u0648\\u0641\\u064a\\u062f-19 \\u062e\\u0644\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0627\\u0626\\u062d\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Supporting over 1 million diagnostic tests annually with international-standard accuracy.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0625\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0623\\u0643\\u062b\\u0631 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0644\\u064a\\u0648\\u0646 \\u062a\\u062d\\u0644\\u064a\\u0644 \\u062a\\u0634\\u062e\\u064a\\u0635\\u064a \\u0633\\u0646\\u0648\\u064a\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0628\\u062f\\u0642\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0637\\u0627\\u0628\\u0642\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0627\\u064a\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0648\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629.\"}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\" Adoption of new technologies (drug-coated balloons, shockwave lithotripsy). \",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u062e\\u062f\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0623\\u062d\\u062f\\u062b \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062b\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0646\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0648\\u0627\\u0626\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062a\\u0641\\u062a\\u064a\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0643\\u0644\\u0633\\u0627\\u062a \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0648\\u062c\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0635\\u0627\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062a\\u062d\\u0633\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u0626\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\" Announcement of upcoming interventional cardiology symposia. \",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u0646 \\u0639\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u062f\\u0648\\u0627\\u062a \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0624\\u062a\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0627\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0645\\u062c\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0637\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u062f\\u0627\\u062e\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629.\"}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-02-10 18:07:04');
INSERT INTO `department_sections` (`id`, `title`, `department_id`, `overview`, `scope_of_unit`, `what_we_treat`, `leadership`, `achievements`, `news`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(27, '{\"en\":\"Blood Bank\",\"ar\":\"قسم بنك الدم \"}', 21, '{\"en\":\"<p>The Blood Bank at AL NAS Hospital is the lifeline of our advanced medical and surgical services. From routine transfusions to highly complex surgeries such as open-heart operations, liver transplantation, and pediatric interventions, our Blood Bank ensures a safe, reliable, and timely supply of blood and blood components. With strict adherence to international transfusion medicine standards, we safeguard every patient’s journey with unmatched accuracy, traceability, and quality.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>يُعد بنك الدم بمستشفى الناس شريان الحياة للخدمات الطبية والجراحية المتقدمة بالمستشفى. فمن نقل الدم الروتيني إلى العمليات الجراحية عالية التعقيد مثل جراحات القلب المفتوح، وزراعة الكبد، وتدخلات جراحات الأطفال، يضمن بنك الدم توفير إمدادات آمنة وموثوقة وفي التوقيت المناسب من الدم ومشتقاته.<br>ونلتزم التزامًا صارمًا بالمعايير الدولية لطب نقل الدم، بما يضمن أعلى درجات الدقة وقابلية التتبع والجودة، حفاظًا على سلامة المرضى في جميع مراحل رحلتهم العلاجية.</p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>Our Blood Bank supports all hospital specialties, ensuring life-saving transfusions for:</p><ul><li><p>Pediatric and adult cardiac surgeries</p></li><li><p>Liver transplantation program</p></li><li><p>Complex gastrointestinal and endoscopic interventions</p></li><li><p>Hematology patients</p></li><li><p>Emergency trauma and burn cases</p></li><li><p>Intensive care and neonatal critical units</p></li></ul>\",\"ar\":\"<p>يدعم بنك الدم جميع التخصصات الطبية بالمستشفى، ويوفر خدمات نقل الدم المنقذة للحياة في:</p><ul><li><p>جراحات القلب للأطفال والبالغين</p></li><li><p>برنامج زراعة الكبد</p></li><li><p>التدخلات المتقدمة للجهاز الهضمي والمناظير</p></li><li><p>مرضى أمراض الدم</p></li><li><p>حالات الطوارئ والإصابات والحروق</p></li><li><p>وحدات العناية المركزة وحديثي الولادة</p></li></ul>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"What we treat\",\"ar\":\"\\u0645\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u064a \\u0646\\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0647\\u061f\"},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p>Our Blood Bank ensures a safe, reliable, and timely supply of blood and blood components for patients in need, including:<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p>\\u064a\\u0636\\u0645\\u0646 \\u0628\\u0646\\u0643 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645 \\u062a\\u0648\\u0641\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0625\\u0645\\u062f\\u0627\\u062f \\u0622\\u0645\\u0646 \\u0648\\u0645\\u0648\\u062b\\u0648\\u0642 \\u0648\\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0642\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633\\u0628 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645 \\u0648\\u0645\\u0643\\u0648\\u0646\\u0627\\u062a\\u0647 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0645\\u0631\\u0636\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062d\\u062a\\u0627\\u062c\\u064a\\u0646\\u060c \\u0648\\u064a\\u0634\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0630\\u0644\\u0643:<\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Congenital and acquired heart diseases requiring surgical interventions.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0623\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0643\\u062a\\u0633\\u0628\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u064a \\u062a\\u062a\\u0637\\u0644\\u0628 \\u062a\\u062f\\u062e\\u0644\\u064b\\u0627 \\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u062d\\u064a\\u064b\\u0627.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Liver failure patients undergoing transplantation.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0634\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0628\\u062f\\u064a \\u0648\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0632\\u0631\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0628\\u062f.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Severe anemia, thalassemia, and hemophilia.\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0646\\u064a\\u0645\\u064a\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u062f\\u064a\\u062f\\u0629\\u060c \\u0627\\u0644\\u062b\\u0644\\u0627\\u0633\\u064a\\u0645\\u064a\\u0627\\u060c \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0647\\u064a\\u0645\\u0648\\u0641\\u064a\\u0644\\u064a\\u0627.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Emergency trauma, burn victims, and bleeding disorders.\",\"ar\":\"\\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0635\\u0627\\u0628\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0637\\u064a\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0631\\u0648\\u0642 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0636\\u0637\\u0631\\u0627\\u0628\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0632\\u0641.\"}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department\",\"ar\":\"\\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":40,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a\"}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":39,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Associate Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a \\u0645\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u062f\"}},{\"doctor\":41,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Associate Consultant\",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a \\u0645\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u062f\"}}]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Supported the first pediatric liver transplant cases at AL NAS Hospital with safe and reliable transfusion services.\",\"ar\":\"\\u062f\\u0639\\u0645 \\u0623\\u0648\\u0644 \\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0632\\u0631\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0643\\u0628\\u062f \\u0644\\u0644\\u0623\\u0637\\u0641\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0628\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0634\\u0641\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633 \\u0628\\u062e\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0646\\u0642\\u0644 \\u062f\\u0645 \\u0622\\u0645\\u0646\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0645\\u0648\\u062b\\u0648\\u0642\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Successful implementation of a 24\\/7 emergency transfusion protocol that reduced intraoperative complications by 30%.\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0637\\u0628\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0628\\u0631\\u0648\\u062a\\u0648\\u0643\\u0648\\u0644 \\u0637\\u0648\\u0627\\u0631\\u0626 \\u0644\\u0646\\u0642\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0645\\u062f\\u0627\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0623\\u0633\\u0647\\u0645 \\u0641\\u064a \\u062a\\u0642\\u0644\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0636\\u0627\\u0639\\u0641\\u0627\\u062a \\u0623\\u062b\\u0646\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u0628\\u0646\\u0633\\u0628\\u0629 30%.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Recognition for maintaining zero transfusion-related infection incidents in the last three years.\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u062d\\u0642\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0635\\u0641\\u0631 \\u062d\\u0627\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0639\\u062f\\u0648\\u0649 \\u0645\\u0631\\u062a\\u0628\\u0637\\u0629 \\u0628\\u0646\\u0642\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645 \\u062e\\u0644\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0646\\u0648\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062b\\u0644\\u0627\\u062b \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u062e\\u064a\\u0631\\u0629.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Blood donor campaigns that engaged thousands of volunteers, creating a sustainable community-based donor pool.\",\"ar\":\"\\u062a\\u0646\\u0638\\u064a\\u0645 \\u062d\\u0645\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u062a\\u0628\\u0631\\u0639 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0645 \\u0634\\u0627\\u0631\\u0643 \\u0641\\u064a\\u0647\\u0627 \\u0622\\u0644\\u0627\\u0641 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062a\\u0637\\u0648\\u0639\\u064a\\u0646\\u060c \\u0645\\u0645\\u0627 \\u0633\\u0627\\u0647\\u0645 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0625\\u0646\\u0634\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0642\\u0627\\u0639\\u062f\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062a\\u0628\\u0631\\u0639\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u062f\\u0627\\u0645\\u0629.\"}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\" Adoption of new technologies (drug-coated balloons, shockwave lithotripsy). \",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u062e\\u062f\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0623\\u062d\\u062f\\u062b \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062b\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0646\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0648\\u0627\\u0626\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062a\\u0641\\u062a\\u064a\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0635\\u0648\\u0627\\u062a \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0648\\u062c\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0635\\u0627\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062a\\u062d\\u0633\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0646\\u062a\\u0627\\u0626\\u062c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u062c.\"}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\" Announcement of upcoming interventional cardiology symposia. \",\"ar\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u0646 \\u0639\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0644\\u0645\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u062f\\u0648\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0642\\u0628\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u062a\\u062e\\u0635\\u0635 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0633\\u0637\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u062f\\u0627\\u062e\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629.\"}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-02-10 18:27:37'),
(28, '{\"ar\":\" -  Copy -  Copy -  Copy\",\"en\":\"Electrophysiology\"}', 2, '{\"en\":\"<p>The cardiac electrophysiology and pacing unit is a highly specialized branch of cardiology, dedicated to diagnosing and treating heart rhythm disorders. It integrates advanced diagnostic tools, interventional procedures, and device therapy to improve patient outcomes and quality of life.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p></p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>The Unit provides comprehensive care for patients with arrhythmias, including supraventricular and ventricular tachycardias, atrial fibrillation, conduction disorders, and sudden cardiac arrest prevention.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Electrophysiology Studies &amp; Ablation:</strong> Mapping and ablation of arrhythmias using conventional and advanced 3D mapping systems.</p></li><li><p><strong>Cardiac Pacing &amp; Device Implantation:</strong> Pacemakers, Lead extraction, Leadless pacemakers, Implantable Cardioverter Defibrillators (ICDs), Cardiac Resynchronization Therapy (CRT).</p></li><li><p><strong>Arrhythmia Clinic:</strong> Remote monitoring, device interrogation, long-term management of patients with arrhythmias and cardiac implantable devices.</p></li></ul>\",\"ar\":\"<p></p>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"What we treat\",\"ar\":null},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p><strong>Adult Cath (Adults \\u2013 Heart &amp; Vascular Procedures)<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>We help adults who have problems with their heart arteries, heart valves, or blood vessels in the body. Conditions include:<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p><\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Fast heartbeats (such as atrial fibrillation, supraventricular tachycardia, and ventricular tachycardia).\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Slow heartbeats that may require a pacemaker.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Irregular heart rhythms (skipped or extra beats that make the heart feel like it\\u2019s racing or fluttering).\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Conduction blocks \\u2013 when the electrical signals in the heart don\\u2019t travel properly.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Sudden cardiac arrest risk \\u2013 using special devices (ICDs) to prevent life-threatening rhythms.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Heart failure rhythm problems \\u2013 treated with special pacemakers (CRT devices) that improve heart function.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Complications from old devices \\u2013 including infections or wires (leads) that need to be removed.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Long-term arrhythmia management \\u2013 regular monitoring and follow-up for patients with heart rhythm devices.\",\"ar\":null}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department\",\"ar\":\"leader 1 ar\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":5,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"ahh\",\"ar\":null}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":null},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":45,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"11\",\"ar\":null}},{\"doctor\":47,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":null,\"ar\":null}},{\"doctor\":55,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":null,\"ar\":null}}]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Successful ablation of complex arrhythmias with high cure rates.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"First-in-country cases of leadless pacemakers.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"First-in-Cairo to introduce pulsed field ablation technology\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Documented improvement in patients\\u2019 quality of life and functional capacity.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Growing annual volume of EPS and device implantation procedures (>30% yearly increase).\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Patient testimonials with restored normal rhythm and improved survival.\",\"ar\":null}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-01-21 16:33:41'),
(29, '{\"ar\":\" -  Copy -  Copy -  Copy\",\"en\":\"Pediatric Cardiology\"}', 2, '{\"en\":\"<p>The pediatric cardiology Unit provides advanced diagnostic and interventional cardiac care for pediatric patients with congenital and structural heart diseases. The unit serves as a cornerstone for minimally invasive procedures, avoiding the need for open-heart surgery whenever possible. The unit also provides advanced diagnostic and interventional pediatric electrophysiological services for pediatric patients with arrhythmias &amp; conduction disorders.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p></p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>The Pediatric Cardiology Department provides state-of-the-art services including fetal echocardiography, interventional catheterization, advanced non-invasive imaging, and pediatric cardiac intensive care. The team is dedicated to delivering holistic care that extends from prenatal detection to long-term follow-up.</p><p>The pediatric cardiology Unit specializes in the evaluation and management of pediatric patients with congenital and acquired heart diseases, as well as pediatric patients with arrhythmias &amp; conduction disorders. In addition to evaluation of fetal cardiac anomalies.</p><p>Using cutting-edge technology, the team performs diagnostic imaging and interventional procedures to restore normal heart function &amp; rhythm.</p><ol start=\\\"1\\\"><li><p><strong>Pediatric cardiology clinic</strong></p></li></ol><p>Clinical evaluation &amp; follow up of neonates &amp; children with congenital or acquired heart diseases before &amp; after cardiac interventions (surgery &amp; catheter interventions)</p><ol start=\\\"2\\\"><li><p><strong>Pediatric echocardiography clinic</strong></p></li></ol><p>Conventional transthoracic Echocardiography, advanced cardiac imaging (tissue Doppler &amp; speckle tacking echocardiography, 3D echocardiography)</p><ol start=\\\"3\\\"><li><p><strong>Pediatric arrhythmia clinic</strong></p></li></ol><p>Diagnosis, management &amp; follow up of pediatric patients with rhythm &amp; conduction disorders.</p><p>Screening for children pre-participation in sports.</p><p>The clinic provides assessment using: 12 leads ECG, Ambulatory ECG (Holter) monitoring, stress testing, programming of implantable devices (Pacemakers &amp; ICDs).</p><ol start=\\\"4\\\"><li><p><strong>Fetal echocardiography clinic</strong></p></li></ol><p>Fetal echocardiography and prenatal counseling.</p><p>Neonatal cardiac assessment and early intervention planning.</p><p>Parental education and family support.</p><ol start=\\\"5\\\"><li><p><strong>Pediatric Cardiac Catheterization unit</strong></p></li></ol><p><strong>Diagnostic cardiac catheterization:</strong></p><p>Diagnostic cardiac catheterization for congenital lesions, hemodynamic studies, Transesophageal echocardiography (TEE).</p><p><strong>Interventional Cardiology:</strong></p><p>·        Balloon angioplasty for stenotic &amp; critically stenotic lesions</p><p>·        Balloon valvuloplasty (aortic, pulmonary).</p><p>·        Coarctation stenting and great vessel interventions.</p><p>·        Pulmonary artery branch stenting</p><p>·        Device closure of septal defects (ASD, VSD, PDA).</p><p>·        Device closure of collaterals</p><p>·        Device closure of abnormal fistulae (as coronary fistulae , Arteriovenous fistulae, …)</p><p>·        PDA stenting in duct dependent cardiac lesions</p><p>·       Right ventricular outflow tract stenting for TOF, PA with hypoplastic PA branches.</p><p>·        Balloon atrial septostomy</p><p>·        Pulmonary valve RF Perforation for pulmonary atresia</p><p>·        Percutaneous Pulmonary valve implantation</p><p>·        Percutaneous Fontan procedure.</p><p>·        Neonatal critical interventions: critical PA, critical AS, PDA stenting.</p><p>·        Emergency lifesaving interventions for critical cardiac lesions in children of all ages</p><ol start=\\\"6\\\"><li><p><strong>Pediatric electrophysiology Catheterization unit</strong></p></li></ol><p>·       Diagnostic EP studies with conventional electric mapping systems</p><p>·       Diagnostic EP studies with 3D electric mapping systems</p><p>·       RF ablation of arrhythmias in pediatric patients</p><p>·       EPS and ablation of complex pediatric arrhythmias.</p><p>·       Transvenous endocardial Pacemaker implantation (single &amp; dual chamber pacemakers) in children.</p><p>·       Left Bundle area pacing in children.</p><p>·       Leadless pacing in ADCH.</p><p>·       Transvenous endocardial ICD implantation (single &amp; dual chamber systems) in children.</p><p>·       Devices &amp; leads extraction</p><p>·       Providing technical support (intraoperative device testing &amp; programming) for surgically inserted devices</p><ol start=\\\"7\\\"><li><p><strong>Cardiac Catheterization unit for Adults with congenital heart diseases (ADCH)</strong></p></li></ol><p>·       Diagnostic and interventional cardiac catheterization in ACHD patients.</p><p>·       Management of ACHD with heart failure, arrhythmias, and critical congenital heart disease.</p><ol start=\\\"8\\\"><li><p><strong>Pediatric cardiac care unit (CCU)</strong></p></li></ol><p>·       Pre &amp; Post-catheterization monitoring and stabilization.</p><ol start=\\\"9\\\"><li><p><strong>Pediatric cardiology ward</strong></p></li></ol><ul><li><p>Evaluation &amp; management of pediatric patients post cardiac surgery or catheterization as well as patients admitted with medical cardiac conditions.</p></li></ul>\",\"ar\":\"<p></p>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"What we treat\",\"ar\":null},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p>We help children who have problems with their heart arteries, heart valves, or blood vessels in the body &amp; those who have too fast or too slow heart rate. Conditions include:<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p><\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Blocked or narrowed major heart arteries (which can cause effort intolerance, chest pain or syncope)\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Valve problems (such as valves that are too tight or that leak)\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Abnormal hole in the heart\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Aneurysms of the aorta (bulges in large blood vessels)\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Children with abnormally rapid heart rate \",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Children with abnormally slow heart rate \",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Babies with bluish discoloration of the body (cyanosis)\",\"ar\":null}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department\",\"ar\":\"leader 1 ar\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":45,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":null}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":null},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":44,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":null}},{\"doctor\":47,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":null}},{\"doctor\":48,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":null}},{\"doctor\":55,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":null}},{\"doctor\":49,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Associate Consultant\",\"ar\":null}},{\"doctor\":54,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":null,\"ar\":null}}]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Leading center in fetal heart screening and early congenital heart disease detection.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"High success rates in pediatric catheterization and device closures.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Documented improvement in survival and quality of life for children with CHD.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Rapid growth in patient volume and procedures performed annually.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Community outreach campaigns for congenital heart disease awareness.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"One of the few centers in Egypt providing diagnostic & interventional service for pediatric arrhythmias \",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Participation in national & community based convoys for screening of pediatric cardiac diseases\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Patients\\u2019 testimonials highlighting rapid recovery and improved quality of life.\",\"ar\":null}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Adoption of advanced techniques (e.g., 3D echo, hybrid cath procedures).\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Recognition of pediatric team for pioneering fetal echocardiography.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Upcoming pediatric cardiology workshops and conferences.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Public awareness campaigns for early congenital heart disease detection.\",\"ar\":null}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-01-27 14:47:04'),
(30, '{\"ar\":\" -  Copy -  Copy -  Copy -  Copy\",\"en\":\"Liver Transplantation & Hepatobiliary Surgery \"}', 8, '{\"en\":\"<p>The Liver Transplantation and Hepato-Bilio-Pancreatic (HBP) Surgery Department at Al Nas Hospital is international center of excellence for referral of complex hepatobiliary-pancreatic surgery and liver transplantation for both adult and pediatric patients. With more than 25 years of experience and over 1,500 successful transplants, including 230 pediatric cases, the department delivers end-to-end care for surgical patients and across the entire transplantation journey from pre-transplant evaluation to lifelong follow-up. With a one-year survival rate of 92%, we continue to set new benchmarks in outcomes.</p>\",\"ar\":\"<p></p>\"}', '{\"en\":\"<p>The Liver Transplantation and Hepato-Bilio-Pancreatic (HBP) Surgery Department provides comprehensive, multidisciplinary care for patients with advanced liver disease and complex hepatobiliary–pancreatic conditions. The unit coordinates integrated pathways that span diagnostic evaluation, surgical planning, liver transplantation, and long-term medical management, supported by advanced imaging, endoscopic services, and interventional radiology. Through close collaboration between adult and pediatric specialists, transplant surgeons, and critical care teams, the department ensures seamless continuity of care, optimized perioperative outcomes, and structured lifelong surveillance for transplant recipients and patients undergoing complex HBP surgeries.</p><ol start=\\\"1\\\"><li><p><strong>Hepato-Bilio-Pancreatic (HBP) &amp; Liver Transplantation Surgery:</strong> Comprehensive surgical care encompassing living-donor liver transplantation for pediatric and adult patients, operative management of benign hepatobiliary disorders, and oncologic resections for hepatobiliary and pancreatic tumors.</p></li><li><p><strong>Pre-Transplant Preparation &amp; Post-Transplant Follow-Up:</strong> Comprehensive patient assessment, transplant candidacy evaluation, immunosuppression initiation, and lifelong surveillance for complications.</p></li><li><p><strong>Adult Hepatology &amp; Gastrointestinal Endoscopy:</strong> Comprehensive care for patients with chronic and advanced liver disease, including full diagnostic and therapeutic endoscopic services for hepatobiliary and pancreatic disorders, as well as longitudinal management of post–liver transplant recipients.</p></li><li><p><strong>Pediatric Hepatology &amp; Gastrointestinal Endoscopy:</strong> Specialized management of end-stage, metabolic, and congenital liver diseases in children, supported by complete diagnostic and therapeutic endoscopic capabilities for hepatobiliary conditions and ongoing care for pediatric transplant patients.</p></li><li><p><strong>Medical Oncology:</strong> Multidisciplinary, medically directed management of hepatobiliary and pancreatic malignancies, providing coordinated long-term treatment planning encompassing chemotherapy, immunotherapy, and radiotherapy.</p></li><li><p><strong>Interventional Radiology &amp; Image-Guided Procedures:</strong> Advanced diagnostic imaging and minimally invasive, image-guided vascular and non-vascular interventions that integrate with surgical and hepatology services to optimize patient outcomes.</p></li></ol><hr>\",\"ar\":\"<p></p>\"}', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"What we treat\",\"ar\":null},\"content\":{\"en\":\"<p>We help children and adults with advanced liver disease through comprehensive evaluation, transplantation, and long-term follow-up care. Conditions include:<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<p><\\/p>\"},\"bullets\":[{\"text\":{\"en\":\"End-stage liver disease (adult and pediatric).\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Biliary atresia and congenital pediatric liver diseases.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Genetic\\/metabolic liver disorders (Wilson disease, PFIC, tyrosinemia, glycogen storage disease, \\u03b1\\u2081-antitrypsin deficiency, Alagille syndrome).\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Benign and malignant liver lesions.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Complex hepatobiliary and pancreatic diseases requiring surgical intervention.\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\"Post-transplant complications and lifelong immunosuppression management.\",\"ar\":null}}]}]', '[{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Head of Department\",\"ar\":\"leader 1 ar\"},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":36,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":null}}]},{\"title\":{\"en\":\"Team\",\"ar\":null},\"doctors\":[{\"doctor\":37,\"doctor_title\":{\"en\":\"Consultant\",\"ar\":null}}]}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}}]', '[{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}},{\"text\":{\"en\":\".\",\"ar\":null}}]', '2025-12-26 06:33:44', '2026-02-01 16:56:10');
